        "headline": "Python has three ways to divide, and each answers a different question.",
        "lead": [
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "/ divides exactly and gives a decimal. // divides and rounds down to a whole number. % gives what is left over. ** raises to a power: 2 ** 3 is 2 × 2 × 2."
          },
          {
            "kind": "callout",
            "tone": "info",
            "text": "Together, // and % split a quantity into whole groups and a leftover."
          }
